---
---
<section class="section google-reviews-section" id="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="heading-lg">What Our Members Say on Google</h2>
      <p>Real feedback from Denver founders, agencies, and remote workers who call Baur's building home.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Reviews Grid Layout -->
    <div class="google-reviews-grid">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Reviewer 1 -->
      <div class="google-review-card">
        <div class="card-top-bar">
          <div class="google-logo-badge">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path fill="#4285F4" d="M23.745 12.27c0-.7-.06-1.4-.19-2.07H12v4.51h6.6c-.29 1.52-1.14 2.82-2.4 3.68v3.05h3.88c2.27-2.09 3.665-5.17 3.665-9.17z"/>
              <path fill="#34A853" d="M12 24c3.24 0 5.95-1.08 7.93-2.91l-3.88-3.05c-1.08.72-2.45 1.16-4.05 1.16-3.12 0-5.77-2.1-6.72-4.93H1.29v3.15C3.26 21.3 7.31 24 12 24z"/>
              <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M5.28 14.27c-.25-.72-.38-1.49-.38-2.27s.13-1.55.38-2.27V6.58H1.29c-.8 1.6-1.26 3.4-1.26 5.42s.46 3.82 1.26 5.42l3.99-3.15z"/>
              <path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 4.75c1.77 0 3.35.61 4.6 1.8l3.42-3.42C17.95 1.19 15.24 0 12 0 7.31 0 3.26 2.7 1.29 6.58l3.99 3.15c.95-2.83 3.6-4.98 6.72-4.98z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="stars-rating">
            <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="review-text">
          "Candy Factory is <span class="quote-highlight">hands down the best coworking environment in Denver!</span> The historic Baur's building gives it character that cookie-cutter office spaces can never match. <span class="quote-highlight">The gigabit fiber wifi speed is lightning fast</span> and Jose and the staff go above and beyond every single day!"
        </p>

        <div class="reviewer-footer">
          <div class="author-avatar">MK</div>
          <div class="author-meta">
            <h5>Marcus K.</h5>
            <p>Google Verified Member • Denver CBD</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Reviewer 2 -->
      <div class="google-review-card">
        <div class="card-top-bar">
          <div class="google-logo-badge">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path fill="#4285F4" d="M23.745 12.27c0-.7-.06-1.4-.19-2.07H12v4.51h6.6c-.29 1.52-1.14 2.82-2.4 3.68v3.05h3.88c2.27-2.09 3.665-5.17 3.665-9.17z"/>
              <path fill="#34A853" d="M12 24c3.24 0 5.95-1.08 7.93-2.91l-3.88-3.05c-1.08.72-2.45 1.16-4.05 1.16-3.12 0-5.77-2.1-6.72-4.93H1.29v3.15C3.26 21.3 7.31 24 12 24z"/>
              <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M5.28 14.27c-.25-.72-.38-1.49-.38-2.27s.13-1.55.38-2.27V6.58H1.29c-.8 1.6-1.26 3.4-1.26 5.42s.46 3.82 1.26 5.42l3.99-3.15z"/>
              <path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 4.75c1.77 0 3.35.61 4.6 1.8l3.42-3.42C17.95 1.19 15.24 0 12 0 7.31 0 3.26 2.7 1.29 6.58l3.99 3.15c.95-2.83 3.6-4.98 6.72-4.98z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="stars-rating">
            <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="review-text">
          "Moving our 5-person team into a private suite here <span class="quote-highlight">boosted productivity and morale immediately</span>. The process was smooth, from the initial tour to setting up our suite. <span class="quote-highlight">Being in the Theatre District makes client meetings effortless.</span> Highly recommend!"
        </p>

        <div class="reviewer-footer">
          <div class="author-avatar">ER</div>
          <div class="author-meta">
            <h5>Elena R.</h5>
            <p>Google Verified Member • Private Suite 205</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Google Summary Box -->
      <div class="google-summary-card">
        <div class="stars-rating large-stars">
          <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
        </div>

        <div class="summary-score-box">
          <span class="score-number">4.9 ★</span>
          <span class="score-text">60+ 5-Star Google Reviews</span>
        </div>

        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          Verified ratings & member testimonials on our official Google Business profile.
        </p>

        <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Candy+Factory+Coworking+Denver" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-block btn-google">
          READ MORE ON GOOGLE <i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.google-reviews-section {
  background-color: var(--bg-light);
  padding: 5.5rem 0;
}

.google-reviews-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1.1fr 0.8fr;
  gap: 2rem;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.google-review-card {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
  padding: 2.2rem;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(1, 33, 57, 0.08);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  transition: transform var(--transition-normal), box-shadow var(--transition-normal);
}

.google-review-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-5px);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
}

.card-top-bar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
}

.google-logo-badge {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #F8FAFC;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
}

.stars-rating {
  color: #FFB800;
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.25rem;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}

.large-stars {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.review-text {
  font-size: 0.98rem;
  color: var(--text-dark);
  line-height: 1.65;
}

/* BRAND ACCENT HIGHLIGHT (Soft Red/Teal Tint instead of off-brand purple/yellow) */
.quote-highlight {
  background-color: var(--primary-red-light);
  color: var(--dark-navy);
  padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-weight: 600;
  border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(214, 64, 80, 0.3);
}

.reviewer-footer {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  padding-top: 1rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
}

.author-avatar {
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--dark-navy);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
}

.author-meta h5 {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--dark-navy);
}

.author-meta p {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

/* GOOGLE SUMMARY CARD STYLES */
.google-summary-card {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
  padding: 2.2rem;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(1, 33, 57, 0.08);
  border: 2px solid var(--border-light);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
}

.summary-score-box {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.2rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.score-number {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 2.8rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--dark-navy);
}

.score-text {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary-red);
}

.btn-google {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-red) 0%, #C02B0A 100%);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-weight: 800;
  padding: 0.95rem 1.4rem;
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-red);
  transition: all var(--transition-normal);
}

.btn-google:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(214, 64, 80, 0.45);
  color: #FFFFFF;
}

/* BOTTOM CALLOUT BAR STYLES (BRAND DARK SLATE NAVY & CANDY RED) */
.reviews-bottom-callout {
  margin-top: 3.5rem;
  background: var(--dark-navy);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  padding: 1.8rem 2.5rem;
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 1.2rem;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--dark-navy-border);
}

.check-icon-circle {
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--primary-red);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-red);
}

.reviews-bottom-callout h3 {
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  font-weight: 700;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .google-reviews-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .google-reviews-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .reviews-bottom-callout {
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
}
</style>
